-# Security Policy
-
-## Supported Versions
-
-The following versions of semver are currently supported:
-
-| Version | Supported          |
-| ------- | ------------------ |
-| 3.x     | :white_check_mark: |
-| 2.x     | :x:                |
-| 1.x     | :x:                |
-
-Fixes are only released for the latest minor version in the form of a patch release.
-
